{"unit_id": "tag:01QH:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的丰沛（ample）的可逆（invertible）层（sheaf）。\n令<MATH_0004>，并将其视为分次环（graded ring）。\n令<MATH_0005>。\n设<MATH_0006>为引理<REF_0001>中的典范态射（canonical morphism）。\n该态射带有一个<MATH_0007>-分次（graded）的<MATH_0008>-代数映射（algebra map）\n<MATH_0009>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "本情形所取的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "修饰所取可逆层的性质。"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "限定层的类型。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "概形上的对象。"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "指明所设环带有分次。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "指所引引理中的态射。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定该代数映射的分次。"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射", "context": "指该态射所配备的映射。"}], "notes": []}
